(
F5 W1 U6: mstring maximum_number_of_strings (manual Professional 4.56,
 initialization part): the maximum number of strings in a define block.
 mstring 4 allows the 4-string define of node 4 below (node 4 1 1).
 The Professional 02-08-2026 rejects every mstring record ("Error in
 initialisation part, double declared: mstring"), so the GNU follows the
 manual (DIVERGENCES MSTRING-PRO). One quad4, E 1000, poisson 0, top
 nodes pushed down by 0.01: sigyy -10 (analytic).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
mstring 4
end_initia
start_define
  top_node node 4 1 1
end_define
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
top_node
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 2 3 4 -ra -velx
bounda_dof 1 -ra 1 2 -ra -vely
bounda_dof 2 -ra 3 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 2 0 0 1 -0.01
control_timestep 0 1 1
target_item 0 -node_dof 4 -sigyy
target_value 0 -10. 1.e-8
end_data
